    {
      "line": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 9.768,
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Next, we want twenty pairs to play without us explaining the puzzles. Can they learn the first combo? Where do they keep failing? Do they choose another room?"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "start": 10.068000000000001,
      "end": 22.716,
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Our proposed twelve-week plan starts with those tests and clearer tutorials, then room and audio polish, followed by accessibility, bug fixes, and release preparation. Those player results are still ahead of us."
    }
